## About MCF

Myndigheten för civilt försvar (MCF) took over responsibility for civil defence, societal protection and preparedness from MSB. MCF is the coordinating authority for cybersecurity supervision under the Cybersecurity Act (2025:150).

## Tasks

- Supervision of entities covered by NIS2
- Support to municipalities and regions in crisis preparedness
- Training and support within civil defence
